# November 22, 2026: Watervliet and the Loudon Road and Troy-Schenectady Road farm country of Colonie behind it.
# Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region conf). Cohoes, Waterford, Green Island and the Watervliet
# canal and bell sites were already worked (conf_simf, conf_biei and others), so this batch takes what those left:
# the St. Patrick's Church site and two canal-era markers in Watervliet, and nine Register-listed houses of the old
# Town of Watervliet (now Colonie and Loudonville), filed under albco like the Pruyn House and Bryan's Store.
# Sources were opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text (tools/wiki_raw.py), HMdb markers, the Times Union and
# the governor's 2022 Register nominations release, through tools/page.py. Addresses from the Wikipedia infoboxes,
# placed with the ArcGIS geocoder and OpenStreetMap building outlines.
